{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35863","headline":"和友人喜相遇十首 一 · 李咸用","name":"和友人喜相遇十首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲儒自愧已多年，文赋歌诗路不专。\n肯信披沙难见宝，只怜苫草易成编。\n燕昭寤寐常求骏，郭隗寻思未是贤。\n且固初心希一试，箭穿正鹄岂无缘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}